181:{"timestamp":"2026-07-22T11:11:08.765Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The revised structural encoding closes: `kprove` now prints `#Top` and exits 0 for both the generalized recursive-call claim and the end-to-end claim. The key proof step is genuine structural induction: symbolic lists narrow to empty, singleton, or two-element-prefix form, and the two-element case reuses the call summary on the strict suffix. I’m now hardening the replay script and adding checks that the verified constructor tree is exactly the current `solution.mpy`.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
